{"seq":2,"slug":"saving-measurement-should-cost","title":"采购节省度量与 should-cost","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/freight-procurement-contract-audit/procurement-performance/saving-measurement-should-cost","wordCount":1921,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"采购节省度量与-should-cost\">采购节省度量与 should-cost</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>&quot;这个项目省了 1,200 万&quot;通常是采购汇报里最不可信的一句话。问题不在数字本身，而在于<strong>基线与口径可以任意选择</strong>：换一个基准年、换一个运量口径、把规避成本算成硬节省，同一段业务能报出相差数倍的节省额。要让它可信，必须先把节省分类、把口径公式化、把基准可复算——然后再谈数字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"节省的三分类\">节省的三分类</h2><p>采购节省不是一种东西，而是三种，它们的可信度与用途完全不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>验证方式</th>\n<th>是否计入财务预算</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>硬节省 (hard savings)</td>\n<td>单价下降 × 实际发生量，可核对到账单</td>\n<td>账单实付价 vs 基准价</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软节省 (soft savings)</td>\n<td>成本规避、需求减少、流程简化带来的少支出</td>\n<td>反事实推演</td>\n<td>通常否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本规避 (cost avoidance)</td>\n<td>避免的涨价（供应商涨价但被挡回）</td>\n<td>涨价通知 + 成交价对照</td>\n<td>部分计入</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"硬节省为什么必须乘实际量\">硬节省为什么必须乘实际量</h3><p>最常见的口径错误是&quot;单价降了 8%，所以按去年的运量算，节省 = 去年运费 × 8%&quot;。这个算法把<strong>议价成功</strong>和<strong>货量变化</strong>混在一起：如果今年运量跌了 30%，那 8% 的单价降幅带来的绝对节省远小于按去年运量算出的数，而真实总额下降的主因是量跌、不是价降——把量跌说成采购成绩，是最典型的自我美化。</p>\n<p>正确的硬节省公式必须以<strong>实际发生量</strong>为权重：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>hard_saving</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mtext>line</mtext></munder><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mtext>line</mtext><mtext>actual</mtext></msubsup><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>P</mi><mtext>line</mtext><mtext>baseline</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>P</mi><mtext>line</mtext><mtext>actual</mtext></msubsup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{hard\\_saving} = \\sum_{\\text{line}} Q^{\\text{actual}}_{\\text{line}} \\times \\left(P^{\\text{baseline}}_{\\text{line}} - P^{\\text{actual}}_{\\text{line}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hard_saving</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">line</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">line</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">actual</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2491em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">line</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">baseline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">line</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">actual</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mtext>actual</mtext></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q^{\\text{actual}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">actual</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是实际计费量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>P</mi><mtext>baseline</mtext></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P^{\\text{baseline}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">baseline</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是基准价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>P</mi><mtext>actual</mtext></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P^{\\text{actual}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">actual</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是实付价。注意实付价应取<strong>审计后的认定价</strong>而非承运商声称价——否则审计发现的超收会被算成&quot;没省下&quot;，而实际它已经被追回。这就是本公式与 <a href=\"../freight-bill-audit-payment/pre-post-freight-audit-rule\">运费审计</a> 的接口。</p>\n<h3 id=\"价格分解-基价降了-总价可能没降\">价格分解：基价降了，总价可能没降</h3><p>只比基价会严重高估节省。运输总价 = 基价 + 附加费，而附加费经常在基价下降的同时被上调——这正是谈判桌上最常见的一招。所以节省计算必须<strong>按总落地价</strong>比较，且要拆开看：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组成</th>\n<th>基准期</th>\n<th>本期</th>\n<th>变化</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基价</td>\n<td>1,850</td>\n<td>1,700</td>\n<td>−150</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>燃油附加费</td>\n<td>210</td>\n<td>285</td>\n<td>+75</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>旺季附加费</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>90</td>\n<td>+90</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>住宅附加费</td>\n<td>6.2/件</td>\n<td>7.1/件</td>\n<td>+0.9</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>总落地价（示例）</strong></td>\n<td><strong>2,060</strong></td>\n<td><strong>2,075</strong></td>\n<td><strong>+15</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>基价降了 8%，总落地价反而涨了。<strong>报告基价降幅而不报告总落地价变化，是一种误导</strong>，无论有意还是无意。</p>\n<h2 id=\"should-cost-不看历史价-看应该值多少\">should-cost：不看历史价，看应该值多少</h2><p>基准价的选择是节省度量的根问题。用&quot;去年价&quot;做基准，等于承认去年的价是合理的——但去年的价可能本身就是超收的、或包含了不合理的附加费。更稳的基准是 <strong>should-cost</strong>：以这个 lane 的客观条件估算&quot;理论成本应该是多少&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"should-cost-的方法学来源\">should-cost 的方法学来源</h3><p>这个方法在政府采购里有成熟的定义。FAR 15.407-4 规定 should-cost review 是成本分析的一种专门形式，它与传统评估方法的根本区别在于：<strong>它不假设承包商的历史成本反映了有效率、经济的运营</strong>，而是评估现有人员、方法、材料、设备、系统与管理的经济性与效率；其实施由一个跨职能团队（合同、合同管理、定价、审计与工程代表）完成（<a href=\"https://www.acquisition.gov/far/15.407-4\">FAR 15.407-4</a>）。该条还区分了<strong>项目级 should-cost review</strong> 与<strong>间接费用（overhead）should-cost review</strong> 两种类型。</p>\n<p>把这两条原则搬到运费采购上：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>不把历史运价当合理基准</strong>，而是从成本驱动因素重建。</li>\n<li><strong>覆盖间接费用</strong>：承运商的报价里含其管理费与利润，should-cost 应把这两部分显式分离出来，而不是当成一个不可谈的常数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"成本驱动因素拆解\">成本驱动因素拆解</h3><p>运费的理论成本可以按驱动因素分解：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>should</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>里程/航程</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>容量占用</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>重量/设备</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>固定作业</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{should}} = \\underbrace{\\alpha \\cdot d}_{\\text{里程/航程}} + \\underbrace{\\beta \\cdot v}_{\\text{容量占用}} + \\underbrace{\\gamma \\cdot w}_{\\text{重量/设备}} + \\underbrace{\\delta}_{\\text{固定作业}} + \\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">should</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2424em;vertical-align:-1.548em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=