\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">固定作业</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3263em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>可观测来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\cdot d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>与距离相关的成本</td>\n<td>里程 / 航线距离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta \\cdot v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>与容量占用相关的成本</td>\n<td>体积 / TEU / 舱位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma \\cdot w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>与重量或设备相关的成本</td>\n<td>计费重量 / 箱型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>固定作业成本</td>\n<td>装卸、单证、口岸作业</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>间接费用与合理利润</td>\n<td>谈判项，非观测项</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>前四项可以基于可观测数据估算，最后一项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 是谈判空间。<strong>should-cost 的价值恰恰在于把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 显性化</strong>——当你把前四项都算清楚，承运商的报价里&quot;剩下的那部分&quot;就是它的管理费加利润，谈判从此有了具体的攻击面。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- should-cost 基准与实付价对照：按 lane 输出差额与占比&#10;WITH should AS (&#10;  SELECT lane_id,&#10;         SUM(alpha * distance_km + beta * volume_cbm + gamma * billed_weight + delta) AS should_cost,&#10;         SUM(billed_weight) AS volume&#10;  FROM should_cost_model&#10;  JOIN freight_volume_cube USING (lane_id)&#10;  WHERE week_start &gt;= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL &#39;52 weeks&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY lane_id&#10;), actual AS (&#10;  SELECT lane_id, SUM(paid_amount) AS paid_amount, SUM(billed_weight) AS volume&#10;  FROM freight_audited_payment&#10;  WHERE accepted_at &gt;= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL &#39;52 weeks&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY lane_id&#10;)&#10;SELECT s.lane_id, s.should_cost, a.paid_amount,&#10;       a.paid_amount - s.should_cost AS gap,&#10;       ROUND((a.paid_amount - s.should_cost) / NULLIF(s.should_cost, 0), 4) AS gap_ratio&#10;FROM should s JOIN actual a USING (lane_id)&#10;ORDER BY gap DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- should-cost 基准与实付价对照：按 lane 输出差额与占比</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> should </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lane_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> distance_km </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> beta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> volume_cbm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gamma </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> billed_weight </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delta) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> should_cost,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(billed_weight) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> volume</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> should_cost_model</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> freight_volume_cube </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (lane_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> week_start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'52 weeks'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lane_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), actual </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lane_id, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(paid_amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> paid_amount, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(billed_weight) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> volume</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> freight_audited_payment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accepted_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'52 weeks'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lane_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lane_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">should_cost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paid_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paid_amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">should_cost</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gap,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paid_amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">should_cost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">should_cost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gap_ratio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> should s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actual a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (lane_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gap </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>gap_ratio</code> 是谈判的优先级排序器：差额最大的 lane 优先重谈，而不是按运量大小排序——运量最大的 lane 可能已经在合理价位上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基准治理-谁能改基准\">基准治理：谁能改基准</h2><p>节省度量的最大风险不是算错，而是<strong>基准被事后修改</strong>。如果度量团队既能报数又能改基准，那么任何一个不好看的数字都能通过调整基准变好看。所以必须做权限分离：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>不得做</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采购执行</td>\n<td>执行谈判、提交节省申报</td>\n<td>不得修改基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>财务/BP</td>\n<td>核定基准与口径、审核申报</td>\n<td>不得参与谈判</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内部审计</td>\n<td>抽样复核原始凭证</td>\n<td>不得修改任何一方数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>基准变更必须走<strong>版本化 + 可追溯</strong>：变更记录包含变更前后值、理由、批准人、生效期。任何追溯修改基准的行为都要在报告里显式披露，因为它会使历史节省额不可比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量口径与资产化的两个收尾问题\">度量口径与资产化的两个收尾问题</h2><p>第一，<strong>节省要能落到成本科目上</strong>。运费节省最终体现为存货成本或期间费用的下降——分界见 <a href=\"../freight-bill-audit-payment/freight-cost-allocation-payment-recon\">运费分摊归集与付款对账</a> 里进货运费计入存货成本、销货运费计入期间费用的规则。如果节省额无法对应到任何一个科目的变化，它就只是汇报数字。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>规避成本要单独披露</strong>。规避成本（本会涨但没涨）本质是反事实，它不应与硬节省混在一个总数里。正确的呈现是分列：硬节省 X、成本规避 Y、软节省 Z，并注明后两者的验证方式与置信度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[合同价 / 实付价 / 审计认定价] --&gt; B{节省分类}&#10;  B --&gt;|单价降 × 实际量| C[硬节省&lt;br/&gt;可对到账单]&#10;  B --&gt;|避免的涨价| D[成本规避&lt;br/&gt;反事实推演]&#10;  B --&gt;|需求减少/流程简化| E[软节省&lt;br/&gt;不计入预算]&#10;  C --&gt; F[基准治理&lt;br/&gt;执行/核定/审计分离]&#10;  F --&gt; G[落成本科目&lt;br/&gt;存货成本 or 期间费用]&#10;  D --&gt; H[分列披露&lt;br/&gt;附置信度]&#10;  E --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; I[可复算的节省报告]&#10;  H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n  A[合同价 / 实付价 / 审计认定价] --&gt; B{节省分类}\n  B --&gt;|单价降 × 实际量| C[硬节省&lt;br/&gt;可对到账单]\n  B --&gt;|避免的涨价| D[成本规避&lt;br/&gt;反事实推演]\n  B --&gt;|需求减少/流程简化| E[软节省&lt;br/&gt;不计入预算]\n  C --&gt; F[基准治理&lt;br/&gt;执行/核定/审计分离]\n  F --&gt; G[落成本科目&lt;br/&gt;存货成本 or 期间费用]\n  D --&gt; H[分列披露&lt;br/&gt;附置信度]\n  E --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; I[可复算的节省报告]\n  H --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>节省分三类：硬节省（可对到账单）、软节省（反事实）、成本规避（避免的涨价）；三者必须分列披露。</li>\n<li>硬节省必须以<strong>实际发生量</strong>为权重，用审计后的认定价而非承运商声称价。</li>\n<li>只报基价降幅而不报总落地价变化是误导；必须按总落地价比较并拆解附加费变化。</li>\n<li>should-cost 不假设历史价合理，从成本驱动因素重建，并把间接费用与利润显性化为谈判面。</li>\n<li>基准治理要权限分离（执行/核定/审计），基准变更版本化且追溯修改必须披露。</li>\n<li>节省额必须能落到成本科目（存货成本或期间费用），否则只是汇报数字。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"采购节省度量与 should-cost","id":"采购节省度量与-should-cost"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"节省的三分类","id":"节省的三分类"},{"level":3,"text":"硬节省为什么必须乘实际量","id":"硬节省为什么必须乘实际量"},{"level":3,"text":"价格分解：基价降了，总价可能没降","id":"价格分解-基价降了-总价可能没降"},{"level":2,"text":"should-cost：不看历史价，看应该值多少","id":"should-cost-不看历史价-看应该值多少"},{"level":3,"text":"should-cost 的方法学来源","id":"should-cost-的方法学来源"},{"level":3,"text":"成本驱动因素拆解","id":"成本驱动因素拆解"},{"level":2,"text":"基准治理：谁能改基准","id":"基准治理-谁能改基准"},{"level":2,"text":"度量口径与资产化的两个收尾问题","id":"度量口径与资产化的两个收尾问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"合同履约与 scorecard 联动（联121）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/freight-procurement-contract-audit/procurement-performance/carrier-contract-scorecard-link"},"next":{"title":"承运商组合与旺季产能风险","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/freight-procurement-contract-audit/procurement-performance/carrier-portfolio-capacity-risk"}}